pan style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sometimes_spit.\" title=\"Sometimes spit.\">Sometimes spit.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_invisible_jump_rope.\" title=\"An invisible jump rope.\">An invisible jump rope.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/My_presumably_scrotum.\" title=\"My presumably scrotum.\">My presumably scrotum.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midnight_picnic.\" title=\"Midnight picnic.\">Midnight picnic.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maybe_we%27re_the_monsters.\" title=\"Maybe we&#39;re the monsters.\">Maybe we're the monsters.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_got_to_be_obsolete.\" title=\"It&#39;s got to be obsolete.\">It's got to be obsolete.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glass_half_most.\" title=\"Glass half most.\">Glass half most.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Science_all_your_life.\" title=\"Science all your life.\">Science all your life.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Getaway_sticks.\" title=\"Getaway sticks.\">Getaway sticks.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The clever side?</strong></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">The clever side?</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/7d/The_clever_side%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703222347\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"The clever side?\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/7d/The_clever_side%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250703222347\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/7d/The_clever_side%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250703222347 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/7/7d/The_clever_side%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20250703222347 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"The clever side?\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"The_clever_side%3F.png\" data-image-name=\"The clever side?.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Getaway_sticks.\" title=\"Getaway sticks.\">Getaway sticks.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/9_x_7.\" title=\"9 x 7.\">9 x 7.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>The clever side?</b></i> is the tenth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_19\" title=\"Series 19\">Series 19</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 3 July 2025. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_clever_side%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nAfter <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> describes <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a>’s stalling tactic during the <a href=\"/wiki/Provide_the_best_drive-through_experience\" title=\"Provide the best drive-through experience\">Provide the best drive-through experience</a> task as \"So clever\", and <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> claims that they’ve \"not seen that side of you before\", Jason asks, incredulously, \"The clever side?\". The title card shows sand from the <a href=\"/wiki/Completely_fill_the_yellow_box_with_sand\" title=\"Completely fill the yellow box with sand\">Completely fill the yellow box with sand</a> task with a hat and some ice from the <a href=\"/wiki/Provide_the_best_drive-through_experience\" title=\"Provide the best drive-through experience\">Provide the best drive-through experience</a> task. The ice may also be a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Stay_completely_still_in_your_powerful_pose\" title=\"Stay completely still in your powerful pose\">Stay completely still in your powerful pose</a> task, as it is \"frozen\".</p><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_clever_side%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table align=\"center\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 0 5px 5px 5px;\">&#8220;\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.5;\"><i>It's the Grand Final, and each contestant has chosen to celebrate in their own unique way: <a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\">Rosie Ramsey</a> puts a wooden box on her head, <a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</a> kicks in a door, <a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\">Mathew Baynton</a> threatens a puppy, and the team known as J. V. Martzoukas<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> (aka <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\">Jason Mantzoukas</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\">Stevie Martin</a>) establish a thriving local business. At the end of it all, <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> will crown one of them the Taskmaster champion, and Little <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> will watch on, knowing that his job is done for another series.</i>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom; font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;, monospace; font-size: 40px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; padding: 5px 5px -3px 5px;\">&#8221;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\">- British Comedy Guide\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: right;\"><small><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"https://www.comedy.co.uk/tv/taskmaster/episodes/19/10/\">[1]</a></small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fatiha_El-Ghorri\" title=\"Fatiha El-Ghorri\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fatiha El-Ghorri</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Mantzoukas\" title=\"Jason Mantzoukas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jason Mantzoukas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mathew_Baynton\" title=\"Mathew Baynton\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mathew Baynton</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rosie_Ramsey\" title=\"Rosie Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rosie Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Stevie_Martin\" title=\"Stevie Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Stevie Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_most_likely_to_make_you_do_a_double-take\" title=\"The thing most likely to make you do a double-take\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing most likely to make you do a double-take.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Completely_fill_the_yellow_box_with_sand\" title=\"Completely fill the yellow box with sand\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Completely fill the yellow box with sand. Once you have touched a box, you must hold that box for the rest of the task.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stay_completely_still_in_your_powerful_pose\" title=\"Stay completely still in your powerful pose\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Freeze on your spot in the most powerful pose in five minutes from now. You must be touching two of the objects.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Stay completely still in your powerful pose for the next 10 minutes.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Provide_the_best_drive-through_experience\" title=\"Provide the best drive-through experience\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Provide the best drive-through experience.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_most_carrot_in_your_bucket\" title=\"Get the most carrot in your bucket\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Get the most carrot in your bucket. You must hold your hands behind your back at all times.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">22\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_clever_side%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>During the filming for the studio segments of the episode, <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex</a> briefly swapped chairs. A very brief shot from this appears during the prize task.\n<ul><li>It was during this episode's filming that Greg realised Alex actually has the more comfortable chair.</li></ul></li>\n<li>This was the first episode to release in July since <a href=\"/wiki/Series_8\" title=\"Series 8\">Series 8</a>'s <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clumpy_swayey_clumsy_man.\" title=\"Clumpy swayey clumsy man.\">Clumpy swayey clumsy man.</a></span>. It is the first episode in the <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> tenure of the show to air in July.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_clever_side%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster\"><i>The clever side?</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_clever_side%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">While British Comedy Guide and a graphic in the episode spells the team's name as \"J. V. Martzoukas\", Stevie has clarified it is spelled \"Javie\".</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141534\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.124 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.201 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1072/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27279/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 817/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 531/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\n